# Folder synchronization, limits (specs/003-folder-sync US9). Run after 14-sync-upload-only.walk with the same server and folders: a pair for the one big file of the
# server (Big, 120 MB) is given a limit of 1 MB; its plan is over the limit and cannot be approved; raising the limit asks first and names the new numbers.
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeSync
waitfor syncPairRow
tap syncAdd
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairServerFolder
waitfor chooserRow
tap chooserRow 0
waitfor chooserPath Big
tap chooserChoose
waitfor pairServerFolder Big
tap pairReaderFolder
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerNewFolder
type Large
tap footerButton 1
wait 500
expect pickerRow Large
tap pickerRow 1
wait 500
tap pickerChooseFolder
waitfor pairReaderFolder Large
# the limits are on the page; the data limit goes down to the smallest value
expect pairMaxFiles Most files
tap pairMaxSize
waitfor pairSizeEntry
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
type 1 MB
tap footerButton 1
wait 400
expect pairMaxSize 1 MB
shot @OUT@/122-pair-limits.png
tap pairSave
waitfor syncPairRow
wait 500
expect syncPairUsage of
shot @OUT@/123-three-pairs.png

# the plan is over the limit: it says which one and by how much, and there is no way to approve it
tap syncPairRow 2
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals download
expect planNotApprovable Over the size limit by
shot @OUT@/124-plan-over-limit.png
tap planCancel
waitfor syncPairRow

# raising the limit names the new numbers first; declining leaves the pair as it was
tap syncPairRow 2
wait 400
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairMaxSize
waitfor pairSizeEntry
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
type 500 MB
tap footerButton 1
wait 400
tap pairSave
waitfor pairLimitConfirm
shot @OUT@/125-raise-limit-confirm.png
expect dialogText 500 MB
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
tap pairCancel
waitfor syncPairRow
tap syncPairRow 2
wait 400
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor pairServerFolder
expect pairMaxSize 1 MB
tap pairMaxSize
waitfor pairSizeEntry
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
type 500 MB
tap footerButton 1
wait 400
tap pairSave
waitfor pairLimitConfirm
tap footerButton 1
waitfor syncPairRow
shot @OUT@/126-limit-raised.png

# the same plan is now within the limits and can be approved (it is not: the next walk starts it and stops the app in the middle)
tap syncPairRow 2
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals download
expect_absent planNotApprovable
shot @OUT@/127-plan-within-limit.png
tap planCancel
waitfor syncPairRow
tap syncBack
wait 300
